# Sequences picked from kragen/xcompose for 50-kragen.compose.
# One per line, as typed after Compose ("Compose " = a further press of it).
# Criteria: practical and guessable; nothing that changes or delays an
# existing sequence; no combining marks, IPA, word expansions or emoji
# (WinCompose's emoji names cover those). Re-run the import after editing.

# Dashes and typographic quotes
-M  # em dash
-N  # – en dash
6'  # ‘
9'  # ’
6"  # “
9"  # ”

# Check marks and crosses
@/   # ✓
@@/  # ✔
@X   # ✗
@@X  # ✘

# Maths and letterlike
in     # ∈
!in    # ∉
cbrt   # ∛
Compose *o  # ∘ ring operator
Compose *.  # ⋅ dot operator
Compose aleph  # ℵ
Compose hbar   # ℏ

# Named symbols
Compose peace  # ☮
Compose yy     # ☯
Compose tea    # ☕
Compose tel    # ☎
Compose chk    # ☑

# Greek letters (classic Greek-keyboard mapping; *a *o *u are taken by X11)
*b
*c
*d
*e
*f
*g
*h
*i
*j
*k
*l
*m
*n
*p
*r
*s
*t
*v
*w
*y
*z
*B
*C
*D
*E
*F
*G
*H
*I
*J
*K
*L
*M
*N
*O
*P
*R
*S
*T
*V
*X
*Y
*Z
